      "name": "Joey C5",
      "purpose": "Joey C5: 4-session rolling upper/lower cycle (Upper A, Lower A, Upper B, Lower B) built around ~3–4 real sessions per week, with face pulls inside Upper A, an optional 30-min bonus day, and optional school-dumbbell routines. Pull-ups replace pulldowns where you already swap, leg press is the main quad lift, sets trimmed to ~20 per session to limit late-session fade. Progression: double progression at 1–2 RIR."
